# Daftar proxy, satu per baris. Baris diawali # diabaikan.
# Format yang didukung:
#   host:port
#   host:port:user:pass
#   http://user:pass@host:port
#   socks5://host:port
#
# Contoh:
# 123.45.67.89:8080
# 123.45.67.89:8080:username:password
# http://user:pass@123.45.67.89:8080
# socks5://123.45.67.89:1080
#
# Copy this file to proxies.txt (real proxy pool, gitignored)